# 2. Docker Architecture

Basic flow:

```text
User
  |
  | docker commands
  v
Docker CLI
  |
  | Docker API
  v
Docker Daemon
  |
  +-------- Images
  |
  +-------- Containers
  |
  +-------- Networks
  |
  +-------- Volumes
  |
  +-------- Plugins
```

For Docker Hub:

```text
Docker CLI
    |
    | docker pull / push
    v
Docker Hub / Registry
```

For Dockerfile:

```text
Dockerfile
    |
    | docker build
    v
Docker Image
    |
    | docker run
    v
Container
```

Useful commands:

```bash
docker version
docker info
docker help
docker <command> --help
docker system df
docker system info
```

Examples:

```bash
docker version
```

Shows Docker Client and Docker Server/Engine versions.

```bash
docker info
```

Shows information about the Docker Engine, containers, images, storage, CPUs, memory, Docker root directory, etc.

```bash
docker system df
```

Shows Docker disk usage.

```bash
docker --help
```

Shows available Docker commands.

