# 32. Mount Named Volume

Create:

```bash
docker volume create appdata
```

Use:

```bash
docker run -d \
  --name mycontainer \
  -v appdata:/data \
  myimage
```

New syntax:

```bash
docker run -d \
  --name mycontainer \
  --mount source=appdata,target=/data \
  myimage
```

---

# 33. Data Persistence

Without volume:

```text
Container
   |
   +-- application data
```

Delete container:

```text
Data in writable container layer → deleted
```

With volume:

```text
Container
    |
    +---- /data
            |
            v
       Docker Volume
            |
            v
       Persistent data
```

Delete container:

```text
Container → deleted
Volume → remains
Data → remains
```

---

