# 47. GitHub Actions — Build Before Push

Useful CI flow:

```text
Checkout
   ↓
Build image
   ↓
Run tests
   ↓
Push image
```

Docker's official documentation also demonstrates building/loading an image, testing it with `docker run`, and then building/pushing the final image.

Example:

```yaml
- name: Build
  uses: docker/build-push-action@v7
  with:
    load: true
    tags: USERNAME/myapp:test

- name: Test
  run: docker run --rm USERNAME/myapp:test

- name: Build and Push
  uses: docker/build-push-action@v7
  with:
    push: true
    tags: USERNAME/myapp:latest
```

