# 59. Compose Network Concept

Compose normally creates a project network.

For example:

```text
compose project
       |
       v
   app network
    /       \
   /         \
 web         db
```

Services can communicate using service names.

Example:

```text
web → db:5432
```

instead of needing to know the database container's IP address.

