# 61. Docker Swarm Mode

Docker Swarm is Docker's built-in orchestration mode.

Important concepts:

```text
Swarm
 |
 +-- Manager nodes
 |
 +-- Worker nodes
 |
 +-- Services
 |
 +-- Tasks
 |
 +-- Containers
```

Example:

```text
             Swarm
               |
       +-------+-------+
       |               |
    Manager          Worker
       |               |
   Service          Task
                       |
                   Container
```

---

# 62. Initialize Swarm

```bash
docker swarm init
```

Example with advertised address:

```bash
docker swarm init --advertise-addr <IP>
```

The node where `docker swarm init` runs becomes a manager.

---

