# 75. Swarm Service Resource Limits

Example:

```bash
docker service create \
  --name web \
  --limit-memory 512M \
  nginx
```

Reservation:

```bash
docker service create \
  --name web \
  --reserve-memory 256M \
  nginx
```

Concept:

```text
Reservation
→ minimum resource requirement used for scheduling

Limit
→ maximum resource the task is allowed to consume
```

---

# 76. Swarm Overlay Network

Create:

```bash
docker network create \
  --driver overlay \
  myoverlay
```

Attachable:

```bash
docker network create \
  --driver overlay \
  --attachable \
  myoverlay
```

Use with service:

```bash
docker service create \
  --name web \
  --network myoverlay \
  nginx
```

Overlay networks allow communication between services/containers across different Docker hosts in a Swarm.

